# QVAC Test Suite Framework - Project Context

## Current State

**Branch**: feature/framework-extraction
**Goal**: Transform monolithic test suite into `@tetherto/qvac-test-suite` library

## Repo Structure

```
qvac-test-suite/
├── framework/                   # @tetherto/qvac-test-suite package (being developed)
├── sdk-tests/                   # Dogfooding structure (will be created)
├── docs/                        # PRDs and plans
│   ├── PRD.md                   # Full PRD
